      "id": "claim_723892aec58942a299d2fc732ea50d7a",
      "statement": "The npm scripts are dev/start (astro dev), build (astro build to ./build), test (six regression guards in sequence: node tests/crypto.test.mjs && node tests/zip.test.mjs && node tests/receiver-chunk-order.test.mjs && node tests/protocol-size.test.mjs && node tests/receiver-options-size.test.mjs && node --no-warnings tests/sdp-robustness.test.mjs — RSA-OAEP 2048-bit modulus, store-only ZIP writer round-trip, per-file chunk-order serialization, MetaData.size int64 wire encoding, receiver Max Size option values/numeric coercion per PR #44, and guarded sdpDecode call sites per PR #45), lint (prettier --check . && eslint .), format (prettier --write .), and protogen (protoc + ts-proto regenerating src/proto/message.ts). The Zero Factory precommit hook's default/all path runs format (prettier --write . + eslint . --fix), then build (tsc --noEmit + astro build), then test (npm test — all six guards).",
